' A conversation by keys (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`: Classic's
' Paradise Camp, as in v12_respawn_classic_full: the snake picked up, then the
' mercenary, record 106). Down lights the first answer, Down again the second
' ("Would you like to work for me?"), Space takes it; in the next, Space
' lights the first answer, Down the second ("OK, you'll get snake"), Space
' takes it: he is hired. A second talk is left with Escape.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 72,152          ' the snake lying here
wait 150
uiclick 266,118
wait 10
esc
wait 10
clickon 106              ' the mercenary: the talk opens
wait 30
press down
press down               ' "Would you like to work for me?"
press space
wait 3
press space              ' the first answer lit
press down               ' "OK, you'll get snake"
press space              ' hired
wait 20
clickon 61               ' somebody else
wait 30
press escape             ' the talk left
wait 5
quit
